version — so the host list is the whole of it.\n\nWorth noting what this also demonstrates: the surrounding #47 machinery is sound. The PTY capture, the idle-settled readiness wait, the session registry and the 15-minute `session_expires_at` all behave as designed; the single-host omission was the only thing preventing the flow from being reachable at all.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/router/issues/comments/5226748598/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]
