+{"body":"## Summary\n\n- copy the committed `ui/dist` bundle into the Docker builder before Rust sources\n- build the default `runtime` image in pull-request CI without pushing\n- require that Docker build before automatic or manual release publication\n- add cross-platform regression tests for the Dockerfile and workflow invariants\n- make cached `cargo-audit` installation idempotent and synchronize the released lockfile version so all CI gates can complete\n\n## Reproduction\n\nOn `main` at `fa90d37`, `docker build .` fails while compiling `src/admin_ui.rs` because `#[derive(RustEmbed)]` cannot find `/app/ui/dist`. The Dockerfile copied `Cargo.toml`, `Cargo.lock`, and `src/`, but not the committed UI bundle.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `docker build --target runtime -t link-assistant-router:issue-59 .`\n- `cargo fmt --all -- --check`\n- `cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features`\n- `cargo test --all-features --verbose`\n- `cargo test --doc --verbose`\n- `cargo package --list`\n- `rust-script scripts/check-file-size.rs`\n- CI/CD pipeline on Linux, macOS, and Windows, including the new Docker image build\n\nLocal Docker image: `sha256:e76232c84bff6c68d00c190b3632a960e096c2b62c19cc2cac902b0a11cf05ad`.\n\nCI: https://github.com/link-assistant/router/actions/runs/31265429407\n\nFixes #59","commits":[{"authoredDate":"2026-08-08T15:18:45Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-08-08T15:18:45Z","messageBody":"Adding .gitkeep for PR creation (default mode).\nThis file will be removed when the task is complete.\n\nIssue: https://github.com/link-assistant/router/issues/59","messageHeadline":"Initial commit with task details","oid":"ace6b800119a458341f05f4539c09f759d7bc889"},{"authoredDate":"2026-08-08T15:33:57Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-08-08T15:33:57Z","messageBody":"Build the default run