+{"body":"Fixes #61.\n\n## Problem\n\nCurrent Claude Code releases print login URLs on `claude.com`. The router accepted only `claude.ai` and `anthropic.com`, so `POST /api/login` captured the URL but rejected it and eventually returned a 502 timeout.\n\n## Solution\n\n- Accept `claude.com` as a Claude authorization host.\n- Add a regression test using the current CLI URL shape: `https://claude.com/cai/oauth/authorize?...`.\n- Add the required bug-fix changelog fragment.\n\n## Reproduction and verification\n\nBefore the allowlist change:\n\n```\ntest login_url::tests::finds_current_claude_cli_url ... FAILED\nleft: None\nright: Some(\"https://claude.com/cai/oauth/authorize?code=true&state=abc\")\n```\n\nAfter the change, the regression test passes.\n\nLocal checks after merging the latest `main`:\n\n- `cargo fmt --check`\n- `cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features`\n- `cargo test` — all unit, integration, and doc-test suites pass\n- `rust-script scripts/check-file-size.rs`\n- changelog fragment check\n- version modification check\n\nThe issue reporter also confirmed the same one-line host addition against a rebuilt `with-claude-cli` image: the endpoint changed from HTTP 502 to HTTP 200 and returned `awaiting_code` with the `claude.com` URL.\n","commits":[{"authoredDate":"2026-08-08T15:48:41Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-08-08T15:48:41Z","messageBody":"Adding .gitkeep for PR creation (default mode).\nThis file will be removed when the task is complete.\n\nIssue: https://github.com/link-assistant/router/issues/61","messageHeadline":"Initial commit with task details","oid":"ddadf6c37efc60270202baad248fdd5e4cdb556c"},{"authoredDate":"2026-08-08T15:52:11Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-08-08T15:52:11Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"test: reproduce current Claude login URL